      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Primero fue Te Kore, la nada. Después vino Te Pō, la noche.",
          "en": "First there was Te Kore: the nothing. Then came Te Pō: the night."
        },
        {
          "es": "Una noche tan larga que nadie podría contarla jamás.",
          "en": "A night so long that nobody could ever count it."
        },
        {
          "es": "En esa noche estaban Ranginui, el Padre Cielo, y Papatūānuku, la Madre Tierra.",
          "en": "In that night lay Ranginui, the Sky Father, and Papatūānuku, the Earth Mother."
        },
        {
          "es": "Se abrazaban tan fuerte que ni un rayo de luz podía pasar entre ellos.",
          "en": "They held each other so tightly that not a single ray of light could pass between them."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y entre ellos, en esa oscuridad apretada, nacieron sus hijos.",
          "en": "And between them, in that cramped darkness, their children were born."
        }
      ],
