        {
          "es": "Entonces le tocó a Tāne.",
          "en": "Then it was Tāne's turn."
        },
        {
          "es": "Puso la cabeza contra su madre, la Tierra, y los pies contra su padre, el Cielo.",
          "en": "He put his head down against his mother, the Earth, and his feet up against his father, the Sky."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y despacio, sin parar, estiró las piernas y empujó, cada vez más fuerte.",
          "en": "Then slowly, steadily, he straightened his legs and pushed, harder and harder."
        },
        {
          "es": "Ranginui y Papatūānuku gritaron: «¿Por qué hacen esto? ¿Por qué separan a sus padres?»",
          "en": "Ranginui and Papatūānuku cried out: 'Why are you doing this? Why tear your parents apart?'"
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero Tāne no se detuvo. Cada vez más alto, el Cielo se fue alejando de la Tierra.",
          "en": "But Tāne did not stop. Higher and higher, the Sky rose away from the Earth."
